{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-06-16 23:46:00', 'title': 'POMERANTZ LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION AGAINST VIATRIS, INC. AND CERTAIN OFFICERS - VTRS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JUNE 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- POMERANTZ LLP ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST VIATRIS, INC. ("VIATRIS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQ: VTRS), AND CERTAIN OFFICERS.\xa0 THE CLASS ACTION, FILED IN THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE WESTERN DISTRICT OF PENNSYLVANIA AND DOCKETED UNDER 23-CV-01098, IS ON BEHALF OF A CLASS CONSISTING OF ALL PERSONS AND ENTITIES OTHER THAN DEFENDANTS THAT PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED VIATRIS COMMON STOCK BETWEEN MARCH 1, 2021 AND FEBRUARY 25, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), SEEKING REMEDIES UNDER THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 (THE "EXCHANGE ACT").'}